// Typing proves `weights.loko`'s `c` is a <circle>, so its three `weight`
// sends call the method through one link instead of asking the runtime.
// Installing an edit repoints every unit's link at the new method, so the
// third send, made after the break, weighs 20: 10 + 10 + 0 + 20.

